  "contentHtml": "<DIV>\r\n<DIV class=txc-textbox style=\"BORDER-TOP: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 10px; PADDING-LEFT: 10px; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-RIGHT: 10px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(254,222,199)\">\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><B><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\">'말머리'에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요^^</SPAN><BR></B></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><B><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.</SPAN></B></SPAN></P></DIV>\r\n<P><BR><!--StartFragment--></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><v:shapetype id=_x0000_t75 stroked=\"f\" filled=\"f\" path=\"m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe\" o:preferrelative=\"t\" o:spt=\"75\" coordsize=\"21600,21600\"><v:stroke joinstyle=\"miter\"></v:stroke><v:formulas><v:f eqn=\"if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"sum @0 1 0\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"sum 0 0 @1\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @2 1 2\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelWidth\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelHeight\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"sum @0 0 1\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @6 1 2\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelWidth\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"sum @8 21600 0\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelHeight\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"sum @10 21600 0\"></v:f></v:formulas><v:path o:connecttype=\"rect\" gradientshapeok=\"t\" o:extrusionok=\"f\"></v:path><o:lock aspectratio=\"t\" v:ext=\"edit\"></o:lock></v:shapetype><v:shape id=_x109405032 style=\"HEIGHT: 125.75pt; WIDTH: 129.64pt; v-text-anchor: top\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\"><v:imagedata src=\"file:///C:\\Users\\Master\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\Hnc\\BinData\\EMB000001102f1e.JPG\" o:title=\"EMB000001102f1e\" cropbottom=\"13393f\"></v:imagedata><w:wrap type=\"topAndBottom\"></w:wrap></v:shape></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/213A19485428F5240D\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"11.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"345\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"345\"  id=\"A_213A19485428F5240DF5ED\"/></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">둥근바닥 플라스크에 물을 조금넣은후 가열한후 물이 끓게 되면 장갑을 끼고 플라스크주둥이에 풍선을 씌웁니다</P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">풍선이 부풀어 오르면 불을 끄고 플라스크에 찬물을 부으면 다시 풍선이 플라스크안에거꾸로 불어집니다</P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">다시 가열하면 부풀어 오릅니다</P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"></P></DIV>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
